    <ferc:CitationAuthorizationForOtherRegulatoryAssets id="f-245" contextRef="c-190">Pursuant to Section 24 of the General Terms and Conditions of PEPL's FERC Gas Tariff, Fourth Revised Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP24-1107-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on October 24, 2024, Docket No. RP25-633-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on March 20, 2025 and Docket No. RP25-1182-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on October 23, 2025. Collected monthly with reimbursement rates revised to be effective on April 1st and November 1st.</ferc:CitationAuthorizationForOtherRegulatoryAssets>
