amily: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Notes:</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"> </td>  <td colspan="4" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Modified Massachusetts   Formula ("MMF") is a combination of revenues, property, and direct   labor costs</span></span><span> </span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"> </td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"> </td>  <td colspan="4" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">to create an allocation   base. The company uses an adjusted MMF that utilizes a combination of   gross</span></span><span> </span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-